  "analyzed_vuln": {
    "function": "GreLayer::getGREVersion",
    "file": "PcapPlusPlus/Packet++/src/GreLayer.cpp",
    "description": "Heap OOB read due to incorrect minimum-length validation in GRE version parsing. getGREVersion() checks greDataLen < sizeof(gre_basic_header), but then unconditionally reads the second byte *(greData+1). In this build, sizeof(gre_basic_header) can be 1 (bitfield-packed layout), so a 1-byte buffer passes validation and causes out-of-bounds read at byte 1.",
    "conditions": "FuzzTarget feeds packet bytes from a crafted pcap/pcapng into Packet parsing. IPv6Layer::parseNextLayer() sees next-header GRE and calls GreLayer::getGREVersion(payload, payloadLen) without additional size guard. If payloadLen is 1 (or otherwise less than 2 but not rejected by the sizeof(gre_basic_header) check), getGREVersion reads past the heap buffer, triggering ASan heap-buffer-overflow."
  },
